                                                "sense_id": "a71b5d5b-4845-3503-81ba-15a34cd724aa",
                                                "text": "Do you have specific questions after seeing the earlier sound and animation sessions? This is the time to get the answers. This late evening session will be held in the computer lab for hands on explanations and will lead into the all-night HackFest."
